{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every path through the forest leads deeper into the fog\u2026but something in the mist already knows who you are.<i></i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Whispers in the Fog</i> is a first- and third-person psychological horror experience focused on atmosphere, exploration, and uncovering a deeply personal mystery hidden within a haunted forest.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You awaken alone in a rain-soaked wilderness with no memory of who you are or how you arrived. Armed with a flashlight, you step into a world swallowed by fog where distant whispers echo through the trees and shadowy figures move just beyond sight.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Guided by faint voices and fragments of forgotten memories, you explore decaying landmarks, abandoned villages, cursed tunnels, and rotting cabins scattered across the forest. Strange artifacts, torn journal pages, and cryptic symbols reveal pieces of a disturbing truth that challenges your perception of reality.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Some whispers guide you. Others deceive you.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3716910/extras/91db32cca3e30ffc4f577c35e49d2b47.poster.avif?t=1773356886\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3716910/extras/91db32cca3e30ffc4f577c35e49d2b47.webm?t=1773356886\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3716910/extras/91db32cca3e30ffc4f577c35e49d2b47.mp4?t=1773356886\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Explore the surroundings and unravel the mystery of your journey\u00a0</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every path leads deeper into the unknown. The further you explore, the more the forest reveals its dark history and the role you may have played in it.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But the truth hidden within the fog may be more terrifying than the monsters that haunt it.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3716910/extras/a750a11e1a9b052ad866908dc0b6d61e.poster.avif?t=1773356886\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3716910/extras/a750a11e1a9b052ad866908dc0b6d61e.webm?t=1773356886\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3716910/extras/a750a11e1a9b052ad866908dc0b6d61e.mp4?t=1773356886\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Gameplay</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Exploration and discovery lie at the heart of <i>Whispers in the Fog</i>. Players begin with a flashlight and a worn backpack, gradually collecting tools, clues, and artifacts needed to solve environmental puzzles and unlock new paths.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each location tells its own silent story through environmental storytelling and interactive elements.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Abandoned villages, forgotten tunnels, haunted structures, and fog-covered cemeteries form a vast interconnected world filled with secrets waiting to be uncovered.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3716910/extras/44b6aaf58a70f17ad5fb801959b289f2.poster.avif?t=1773356886\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3716910/extras/44b6aaf58a70f17ad5fb801959b289f2.webm?t=1773356886\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3716910/extras/44b6aaf58a70f17ad5fb801959b289f2.mp4?t=1773356886\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Atmosphere and Lighting\u00a0</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dynamic weather, volumetric fog, and cinematic lighting shape the world of <i>Whispers in the Fog</i>. Storms roll through the forest, rain distorts distant lights, and shadows stretch unnaturally through the trees.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The fog is not just a visual element \u2014 it is a presence.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >From the moment you awaken in the forest, the environment feels alive with quiet dread. Light is scarce, visibility is limited, and distant shapes often blur the line between illusion and reality.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sometimes the forest shows you the way forward.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sometimes it hides what should never be found.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3716910/extras/f1bd90984f84fb8322474f2ab541b714.poster.avif?t=1773356886\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3716910/extras/f1bd90984f84fb8322474f2ab541b714.webm?t=1773356886\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3716910/extras/f1bd90984f84fb8322474f2ab541b714.mp4?t=1773356886\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features\u00a0</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Atmospheric First and Third Person Horror</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Switch perspectives to experience the forest from different viewpoints and immerse yourself in a haunting world where fog, darkness, and silence create constant tension.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Environmental Puzzle Solving</strong> <br>Solve layered puzzles using clues hidden throughout the world. Symbols, artifacts, and journal entries reveal new paths and deepen the narrative.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Psychological Sound Design</strong> <br>3D spatial audio and unsettling ambient soundscapes blur the line between reality and hallucination. Whispers may guide you\u2026 or mislead you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Cinematic Lighting and Fog Effects</strong> <br>Powered by Unreal Engine 5, dynamic lighting and volumetric fog shape every environment, building suspense and enhancing the atmosphere of dread.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Fragmented Narrative</strong> <br>Uncover scattered memories, notes, and artifacts that slowly piece together the truth behind your identity and the forest\u2019s disturbing past.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Nonlinear Exploration</strong> <br>Freely explore an interconnected world of abandoned locations, forgotten paths, and hidden ruins \u2014 each with its own story to uncover.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Minimal UI, Maximum Immersion</strong> <br> A physical backpack and journal system allow players to manage items and clues without breaking immersion.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Subtle Horror, Lasting Impact</strong> <br>No jump scare overload just creeping dread, psychological unease, and moments that stay with you long after the game is over.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Encounters and combat</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The forest is not empty.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Strange entities and shadowy figures roam the fog, drawn to the echoes of your past.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You must rely on the tools you find to survive:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A flashlight used to reveal, repel, or disrupt supernatural threats</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Improvised melee weapons such as pipes, crowbars, or axes</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Limited firearms that provide temporary protection in desperate moments</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Combat is intentionally tense and restrained. Some encounters can be confronted, while others are better avoided.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Survival depends on awareness, observation and the courage to move forward even when the forest whispers for you to turn back.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3716910?t=1773356886","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3716910?t=1773356886","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3716910/60b9293f01d5337521e2907ac8270a00b76d48b4/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1773356886","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3716910/60b9293f01d5337521e2907ac8270a00b76d48b4/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1773356886","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every path through the forest leads deeper into the fog\u2026but something in the mist already knows who you are.<i></i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Whispers in the Fog</i> is a first- and third-person psychological horror experience focused on atmosphere, exploration, and uncovering a deeply personal mystery hidden within a haunted forest.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You awaken alone in a rain-soaked wilderness with no memory of who you are or how you arrived. Armed with a flashlight, you step into a world swallowed by fog where distant whispers echo through the trees and shadowy figures move just beyond sight.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Guided by faint voices and fragments of forgotten memories, you explore decaying landmarks, abandoned villages, cursed tunnels, and rotting cabins scattered across the forest. Strange artifacts, torn journal pages, and cryptic symbols reveal pieces of a disturbing truth that challenges your perception of reality.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Some whispers guide you. Others deceive you.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3716910/extras/91db32cca3e30ffc4f577c35e49d2b47.poster.avif?t=1773356886\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3716910/extras/91db32cca3e30ffc4f577c35e49d2b47.webm?t=1773356886\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3716910/extras/91db32cca3e30ffc4f577c35e49d2b47.mp4?t=1773356886\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Explore the surroundings and unravel the mystery of your journey\u00a0</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every path leads deeper into the unknown. The further you explore, the more the forest reveals its dark history and the role you may have played in it.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But the truth hidden within the fog may be more terrifying than the monsters that haunt it.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3716910/extras/a750a11e1a9b052ad866908dc0b6d61e.poster.avif?t=1773356886\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3716910/extras/a750a11e1a9b052ad866908dc0b6d61e.webm?t=1773356886\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3716910/extras/a750a11e1a9b052ad866908dc0b6d61e.mp4?t=1773356886\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Gameplay</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Exploration and discovery lie at the heart of <i>Whispers in the Fog</i>. Players begin with a flashlight and a worn backpack, gradually collecting tools, clues, and artifacts needed to solve environmental puzzles and unlock new paths.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each location tells its own silent story through environmental storytelling and interactive elements.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Abandoned villages, forgotten tunnels, haunted structures, and fog-covered cemeteries form a vast interconnected world filled with secrets waiting to be uncovered.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3716910/extras/44b6aaf58a70f17ad5fb801959b289f2.poster.avif?t=1773356886\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3716910/extras/44b6aaf58a70f17ad5fb801959b289f2.webm?t=1773356886\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3716910/extras/44b6aaf58a70f17ad5fb801959b289f2.mp4?t=1773356886\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Atmosphere and Lighting\u00a0</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dynamic weather, volumetric fog, and cinematic lighting shape the world of <i>Whispers in the Fog</i>. Storms roll through the forest, rain distorts distant lights, and shadows stretch unnaturally through the trees.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The fog is not just a visual element \u2014 it is a presence.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >From the moment you awaken in the forest, the environment feels alive with quiet dread. Light is scarce, visibility is limited, and distant shapes often blur the line between illusion and reality.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sometimes the forest shows you the way forward.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sometimes it hides what should never be found.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3716910/extras/f1bd90984f84fb8322474f2ab541b714.poster.avif?t=1773356886\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3716910/extras/f1bd90984f84fb8322474f2ab541b714.webm?t=1773356886\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3716910/extras/f1bd90984f84fb8322474f2ab541b714.mp4?t=1773356886\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features\u00a0</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Atmospheric First and Third Person Horror</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Switch perspectives to experience the forest from different viewpoints and immerse yourself in a haunting world where fog, darkness, and silence create constant tension.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Environmental Puzzle Solving</strong> <br>Solve layered puzzles using clues hidden throughout the world. Symbols, artifacts, and journal entries reveal new paths and deepen the narrative.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Psychological Sound Design</strong> <br>3D spatial audio and unsettling ambient soundscapes blur the line between reality and hallucination. Whispers may guide you\u2026 or mislead you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Cinematic Lighting and Fog Effects</strong> <br>Powered by Unreal Engine 5, dynamic lighting and volumetric fog shape every environment, building suspense and enhancing the atmosphere of dread.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Fragmented Narrative</strong> <br>Uncover scattered memories, notes, and artifacts that slowly piece together the truth behind your identity and the forest\u2019s disturbing past.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Nonlinear Exploration</strong> <br>Freely explore an interconnected world of abandoned locations, forgotten paths, and hidden ruins \u2014 each with its own story to uncover.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Minimal UI, Maximum Immersion</strong> <br> A physical backpack and journal system allow players to manage items and clues without breaking immersion.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Subtle Horror, Lasting Impact</strong> <br>No jump scare overload just creeping dread, psychological unease, and moments that stay with you long after the game is over.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Encounters and combat</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The forest is not empty.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Strange entities and shadowy figures roam the fog, drawn to the echoes of your past.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You must rely on the tools you find to survive:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A flashlight used to reveal, repel, or disrupt supernatural threats</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Improvised melee weapons such as pipes, crowbars, or axes</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Limited firearms that provide temporary protection in desperate moments</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Combat is intentionally tense and restrained. Some encounters can be confronted, while others are better avoided.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Survival depends on awareness, observation and the courage to move forward even when the forest whispers for you to turn back.</p>","developers":["Pasquale Scionti"],"genres":[{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3716910/e19c751e6acc8f23c7e273ad56d229d8f17ffff9/header.jpg?t=1773356886","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3716910/491237817/ceb1caaa82d4bad4ec33236b0b1c7d2576ffc564/1773346343/dash_av1.mpd?t=1773351960","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3716910/491237817/ceb1caaa82d4bad4ec33236b0b1c7d2576ffc564/1773346343/dash_h264.mpd?t=1773351960","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3716910/491237817/ceb1caaa82d4bad4ec33236b0b1c7d2576ffc564/1773346343/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1773351960","id":257302222,"name":"Whispers in the Fog Gameplay Concept","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257302222/c3c62f2ea6b51934551edfce8b95ba5273a78502/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1773351960"},{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3716910/2116189469/925f6abd0f0390d2fdfe33d4a88aebd0e62e6a71/1771191344/dash_av1.mpd?t=1771193088","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3716910/2116189469/925f6abd0f0390d2fdfe33d4a88aebd0e62e6a71/1771191344/dash_h264.mpd?t=1771193088","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3716910/2116189469/925f6abd0f0390d2fdfe33d4a88aebd0e62e6a71/1771191344/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1771193088","id":257254263,"name":"Whispers in the fog Updated Trailer","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257254263/cd8c6707283a6a55734eac44861d271c7e36f94b/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1771193088"},{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3716910/1671924876/2f124302e63fd1f8b37bdfa18a6519ac74b7a95f/1755895339/dash_av1.mpd?t=1755897044","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3716910/1671924876/2f124302e63fd1f8b37bdfa18a6519ac74b7a95f/1755895339/dash_h264.mpd?t=1755897044","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3716910/1671924876/2f124302e63fd1f8b37bdfa18a6519ac74b7a95f/1755895339/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1755897044","id":257187396,"name":"Whispers in the fog Teaser","thumbnail